[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3506639215","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112542#issuecomment-3506639215","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112542","id":3506639215,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RAxFv","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-08T15:27:03Z","updated_at":"2025-11-08T15:27:03Z","body":"The `visibility_changed` signal refers to [changes on the node's `visible` property](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node3d.html#class-node3d-signal-visibility-changed), not if they're actually visible on the screen currently:\n\n> Emitted when this node's visibility changes (see [visible](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node3d.html#class-node3d-property-visible) and [is_visible_in_tree()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node3d.html#class-node3d-method-is-visible-in-tree)).\n> \n> This signal is emitted after the related [NOTIFICATION_VISIBILITY_CHANGED](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node3d.html#class-node3d-constant-notification-visibility-changed) notification.\n\nWhat you probably want in this scenario is to use [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_visibleonscreennotifier3d.html), which tests whether the object is really visible on the screen.\n\nMaybe the documentation can be amended to include this remark.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3506639215/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4590861260","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112542#issuecomment-4590861260","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112542","id":4590861260,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEaL7zA","user":{"login":"Lerpwave","id":208300468,"node_id":"U_kgDODGpptA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/208300468?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave","html_url":"https://github.com/Lerpwave","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lerpwave/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-01T08:30:31Z","updated_at":"2026-06-01T08:32:19Z","body":">What you probably want in this scenario is to use [VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_visibleonscreennotifier3d.html), which tests whether the object is really visible on the screen.\n\nCorrect me if I'm wrong, but VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D tests if the box-shaped region is visible, not if the object is visible on screen with visibility range.\n\nI can't find any way to know if the object is visible or not with visibility range.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4590861260/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4671901258","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112542#issuecomment-4671901258","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112542","id":4671901258,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFneOSg","user":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T15:42:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T15:42:49Z","body":"> Correct me if I'm wrong, but VisibleOnScreenNotifier3D tests if the box-shaped region is visible, not if the object is visible on screen with visibility range.\n\nYup; both variants use a simpler shape (Rect in 2D, AABB on 3D), I assume for performance reasons.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4671901258/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]